    {
      "chapter": 213,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER213.YBC",
      "sha256": "91bec61cfb13b15020e4b983ecaf0aeba865c7a1b53162efd5d5e11062bdaecf",
      "text_count": 25,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 198,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "法爾德留下的信你應該已經看過了吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 236,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "……是的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 268,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            2,
            3
          ],
          "text": "就算到了最後的最後，\n他也還是想操縱我們的行動的樣子。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 290,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 352,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            5,
            6,
            7,
            8,
            9
          ],
          "text": "在傑諾巴特斯的遺跡裡，\n有著需要純潔之盾幫忙的人……\n如果各位願意的話，\n那一位應該也會是純潔之盾所需要的人才。\n他這話還說得真是漂亮呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 374,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 402,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "都已經被他說成這樣了……\n看來，好像是非去不可了呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 424,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 446,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            14
          ],
          "text": "呼嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 468,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            15
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 508,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            16,
            17,
            18,
            19
          ],
          "text": "沒關係的，就算有什麼萬一的話，\n雖然那應該是不可能的啦，\n就算這是一個陷阱也好，\n這應該也會是一趟很好的冒險呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 530,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 213,
          "source_offset": 570,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22,
            23,
            24
          ],
          "text": "沒錯，\n雖然我不是很明白我朋友究竟在想些什麼……\n至少，我願意相信他，\n絕對不會準備了一個陷阱給我們跳下去的。"
        }
      ],
